silm:instances_papers_07_the_canonical_question_chapters_08_cross_paper_bridges_sections_05_bridge_to_11_base_commutative_yoneda_hom_leg_7 silm:hasExample "In 'P07CrossPaperBridgesBridgeTo11BaseCommutativeYonedaHomLeg7', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, the Avro-serialized VetRecord blob in the granite-storage chunk-manifest: a storage-materialization arrow into D_Mittens for the evidence artifact." .
